<!--sheet-->
# Construction programme for a ground slab

The durations are worked out from quantities and production rates, rounded up to whole days,
and typed into the Gantt chart. Change a rate, then change the matching duration in the chart.

## Quantities and rates
A_slab: 30 m * 12 m -> m² | slab area
V_exc: A_slab * 0.45 m -> m³ | excavation
rate_exc: 80 m³/d | excavation rate
rate_reo: 120 m²/d | reinforcement fixing rate
V_conc: A_slab * 0.2 m -> m³ | concrete
rate_pour: 60 m³/d | pump rate

## Durations
t_exc: ceiling(V_exc / rate_exc / 1 d) | days to excavate
t_reo: ceiling(A_slab / rate_reo / 1 d) | days to fix reinforcement
t_pour: ceiling(V_conc / rate_pour / 1 d) | days to pour
t_cure: 7 | days of curing
t_total: t_exc + t_reo + t_pour + t_cure | working days in total

```mermaid
gantt
  title Ground slab
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %d %b
  section Earthworks
  Excavate and trim  :exc, 2026-11-02, 3d
  section Slab
  Fix reinforcement  :reo, after exc, 3d
  Pour concrete      :pour, after reo, 2d
  Cure               :cure, after pour, 7d
  section Milestone
  Slab complete      :milestone, after cure, 0d
```
